    "name": "Cosmic Gold Potato",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">The Cosmic Gold potato is&nbsp;a variety known for its early, high yield and good flavor, making it suitable for fresh market sales.&nbsp;It's similar to the popular&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv=9faf4b2dd5f8b9e4&amp;rlz=1CAVNCX_enUS1049US1049&amp;cs=0&amp;sxsrf=AE3TifOTjh8NdXX_hLSKkI8suMoOFPwe7Q%3A1752346132253&amp;q=Yukon+Gold&amp;sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwinrdaF_reOAxVMl-4BHUPmDwgQxccNegQIBBAB&amp;mstk=AUtExfDzOqFJDrxvnJOgJV3N4baF0Dm8rwBrLhcmVh84oAmfLa3Br5aFUTfEkwp2AK18wEXGFltZyVlQnRnCUi-w78SUNxnIYGL4v29MPE8aSgWfVEwm-1orh9RlE-_9x5k1eQwjPCYxN9uPuivsKcIHFwTNYBmoMnGEe5--1XvCMo0r3aSK01bA5jfkEA0-Od_nHO2c68utkXy_jKv5e7_WIhmMKVsxPdomM4lI5qglTEgujQMZttG24Ug3zcbJ1-RnGhrhyrMlw1NVfD-gqtzuBl1wLExDwvEC31e3D3CK6QkJuZcBBEyd-vFmGnh7wmSu4pT_Bx98dDXZO4dQMZiUZx3RLZclArbrG0Q2jYL1Zd_jnIqDxr2N-YCGpyxjV5Mc7AXKGbFUi6ooEuAdTxGJxA&amp;csui=3\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"lexical-text-editor--link\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Yukon Gold</span></a><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">,&nbsp;with smooth, yellow skin and flesh, and shallow eyes.&nbsp;These potatoes are versatile, holding their shape well when cooked, making them great for salads, stews, and roasting.</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">These are creamy delicious, beautiful, and smaller in size.&nbsp; They are great for roasting!</span></p>",
